wave          ties     density   avg. degree
1               74      0.0604         2.960
2               81      0.0661         3.240
3               77      0.0629         3.080
----------------------------------------------------------
period      kept  created dissolved  Jaccard   Hamming
1->2          43       38        31    0.384        69
2->3          47       30        34    0.423        64
----------------------------------------------------------

. 
. * No reciprocity effect: every tie is reciprocated by definition.
. * The default model: one pupil proposes a change and imposes it (forcing).
